<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Disco's Go To Rend, or D.G.T.R is a macro that works with any and all DPI/SENS/RESOLUTION/ASPECTRATIO and is designed to automate some of the typing in LC! To activate, bind to any key (we recommend 1-9 or F1-F12 so it doesn't interfere with keys in the alphabet, you can use shift+a for example to avoid this if you really want to use any of the text keys) and then enter the text field and use your hotkey and viola.

v1.0</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
